tweets by year: 2008:6 2009:64 2010:14 2011:86 2012:1360 2013:1852 2014:1966 2015:2321 2016:1098 2017:733 2018:462 2019:1091 2020:1297 2021:959 2022:607 2023:2843 2024:10973 2025:1807
