shape: two builds and a flood. 2012-2015 the first spanning (peak replies 2015: 1,398); 2016-2022 the long sag, ending in the quietest full year (607 tweets, 2022) that produced the artifact; 2023 the naming and surge; 2024 the flood - 37.1% of all tweets and 40.6% of all replies in a single year; 2025 the snapshot closes mid-year.
DM messages by year: 2012:14 2013:28 2014:7 2015:143 2016:72 2017:43 2018:1 2019:34 2020:32 2021:23 2022:6 2023:739 2024:3630 2025:1305 - the private channel was near-silent for a decade (1 message in 2018) and ignited exactly with the artifact era.
